lec05kp10-u01-p1-nf-lec05-kp10-p1-111.text:
Generalization: still predicting new data
that was not used in training correctly;
not memorizing the original answers.

lec05kp10-u01-p2-nf-lec05-kp10-p2-39.text:
Free parameter: a number that
training can change independently;
weights and biases both count.
